          "jcr:created": "Tue Aug 22 2023 13:57:15 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h1><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Cerebrovascular health</span></span></span></h1>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">This advanced educational program offers a new, updated virtual training option that will leave attendees feeling more confident in performing the NIHSS. Content includes basic neuroanatomy, history and significance of the NIHSS, and NIHSS steps 1-11 with instruction and tips on where to localize a stroke. This virtual course can be used for additional NIHSS training and potentially as part of a pathway for NIHSS certification.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Next steps to take the NIHSS Training Course:</span></p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Download the 3 course resources below as they are helpful tools for you</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Click &quot;View Resources&quot;</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Create a log-in by clicking &quot;New User Self Register&quot;</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Search for &quot;NIHSS&quot; or &quot;Stroke&quot; to access the course</span><br>\n&nbsp;</li>\n</ol>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Jan 08 2024 19:58:41 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
